        <briefdescription>
<para>Add words with associated frequency counts to the vocabulary. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Registers each word in the spelling-correction vocabulary and records its corpus frequency. When multiple candidates share the same edit distance, higher-frequency words are ranked first and receive a higher confidence score. Calling this function multiple times for the same word accumulates the frequency counts.</para>
